#: src/imagepaste.cpp:30
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Save the document before pasting an image: the image is stored beside it."
msgstr ""
"Gorde dokumentua irudi bat itsatsi aurretik: irudia haren ondoan gordetzen "
"da."

